+# Actually paper's "BF16 w/ MW" uses FP32 master weights, but this config simulates BF16 storage.
+# For true BF16 mixed precision baseline, use training.dtype = "bfloat16" and eco.quantize_weights = false.
+#
+# Based on ECO paper hyperparameters:
+#   - AdamW, beta1=0.9, beta2=0.98, eps=1e-9, wd=0.1, grad clip 1.0
+#   - LR scaling: 1.2e-3 * 50M/N_params (QUEST scaling law)
+#   - Linear warmup (10% steps), cosine decay to 0.1x peak
